/* -------------------- Reproducible random streams ------------------- */

/** FNV-1a over code points. Exported since 0.32.0 (MIGRATION_MAP gap 22): it is a 32-bit digest for
 *  bucketing and stream derivation, never an identity — `contentKey` keeps the canonical form when
 *  it needs a key that cannot collide. */
