/* Vector kernels index off (workgroup_id.x + workgroup_id.y*groupsX) so a job larger than
 * maxComputeWorkgroupsPerDimension workgroups folds into a 2-D grid instead of emitting an
 * invalid dispatch that WebGPU drops without failing the JS call. */
