/* What this models is resource residency plus the transients the runtime itself allocates. Two
 * things it must never do: cost an undeclared resource at zero (executePipeline creates those for
 * real, at whatever size the stage hands it), and report feasible:true for a pipeline whose size it
 * could not establish. Both used to happen silently — `options.executors` (or plan stages carrying
 * their resolved `residence`) keeps custom executors from being counted on both sides, and
 * `options.gpuPoolCachedBytes` accounts for the buffer pool's retained cache. */
